    {"Where in the range the stretch begins.", "设定高光扩展的起始亮度。"},
    {"How a smaller picture is enlarged to the window.", "设置画面放大的采样方式。"},
    {"Bilinear filtering on text, sprites and effects. Off samples them as the PS2 did.", "为文字、二维图像和效果启用双线性过滤。"},
    {"Move the camera between the game's frames. Off repeats the same picture.", "在原有游戏帧之间插入镜头变化。"},
    {"Move characters and objects between the game's frames too, not only the camera.", "在原有游戏帧之间插入角色和物件的动作。"},
    {"Hard is the PS2's one-tap edge; soft averages it.", "选择原版硬边或平滑的投影阴影。"},
    {"Discards any texel fainter than this. A blunter tool; 0 is off.", "丢弃透明度低于阈值的像素，0 为关闭。"},
