    {" (Not available with the current settings.)", "（当前设置下不可用。）"},
    {"Type A: Triangle raises the Camera Obscura, Cross or R1 takes the picture and L1 a lens shot.", "A 型：三角键举起射影机，叉键或 R1 拍摄，L1 使用镜头能力拍摄。"},
    {"Type B: Triangle raises the Camera Obscura, Cross or R1 takes the picture and Circle a lens shot.", "B 型：三角键举起射影机，叉键或 R1 拍摄，圆圈键使用镜头能力拍摄。"},
    {"Type C: R1 raises the Camera Obscura, Cross takes the picture and Triangle or L1 a lens shot.", "C 型：R1 举起射影机，叉键拍摄，三角键或 L1 使用镜头能力拍摄。"},
    {"The game's three button layouts. ", "游戏内的三种按键布局。"},
    {"The game's own brightness filter over the world, in twelve steps; it starts on 7. ", "调整游戏内画面亮度，共 12 档，默认第 7 档。"},
    {"The game's own settings -- here and on the Audio and Controls pages -- back as the game starts them. Bindings are kept.", "恢复「游戏」「音频」和「控制」中的原版默认设置，并保留按键绑定。"},
    {" The display reports SDR white at %.0f nits and a %.0f nit peak.", "显示器报告的 SDR 白点为 %.0f 尼特，峰值为 %.0f 尼特。"},
    {" The scene is 8-bit; restart with HDR on for 10-bit.", "当前场景使用 8 位色深，开启 HDR 后重启即可使用 10 位。"},
    {"Auto fills the window and shows more of the world at the sides. Original keeps the PS2's 640x448 framing.", "「自动」填满窗口并扩展两侧视野。「原版」保持 PS2 的 640×448 构图。"},
    {"How bright the game's white is in HDR: the system's SDR white, or a level of your own.", "设置 HDR 画面中的白色亮度，可使用系统的 SDR 白点或手动指定。"},
    {"The brightest the picture may go: what the display reports, or a level of your own.", "设置画面峰值亮度，可使用显示器报告的值或手动指定。"},
    {"Stretches the brightest tones into the HDR headroom. 0 invents nothing -- the faithful setting.", "将高亮区域扩展至 HDR 的亮度范围。设为 0 时保持原始亮度。"},
    {"Which graphics API draws the game. Auto suits most systems. Drawing with %s now.", "选择渲染游戏的图形 API。大多数系统可用「自动」。当前后端为 %s。"},
    {" Restart ReiPan to switch to %s.", "重启 ReiPan 后切换到 %s。"},
    {" %s could not be started.", "无法启动 %s。"},
    {" SDL_GPU_DRIVER is set and overrides this setting.", "环境变量 SDL_GPU_DRIVER 覆盖了此设置。"},
    {"Match the window, the PS2's own 640x448 times a scale, or the window times a scale.", "可使用窗口大小，或以 PS2 的 640×448 分辨率或窗口大小为基准缩放。"},
    {"The multiplier for the mode above. The game is drawn at %dx%d now.", "调整所选模式的缩放倍率。当前渲染分辨率为 %d×%d。"},
    {"Multisampling smooths the edges of the world. Costly in scenes full of effects, which read the frame back.", "多重采样可平滑场景边缘，特效密集且需要回读画面的场景开销较大。"},
    {"Anisotropic filtering keeps floors sharp at grazing angles. Close to free.", "各向异性过滤能提高清晰度，尤其是以较低视角看地面时，性能开销很小。"},
    {"Frames shown between the game's own, the camera moved to each one's moment. The game still runs at its own pace.", "在原有游戏帧之间插入画面，并按对应时刻更新镜头。游戏逻辑帧率照常运行。"},
    {"Vertex lights every vertex on the CPU, as the PS2 did. The per-pixel modes light spotlights, or everything, per pixel.", "「逐顶点」沿用 PS2 的 CPU 顶点照明。逐像素模式按选项计算聚光灯或全部灯光。"},
    {"The grain over the picture: off, the PS2's sheet at its own size, or one grain per screen pixel.", "叠加画面颗粒。可关闭、沿用 PS2 的原尺寸，或按屏幕像素生成。"},
    {"Restores the crisp alpha edge on foliage, fences and hair when the picture is drawn above the PS2's size.", "在高于 PS2 分辨率时保持树叶、栅栏和头发的透明边缘清晰。"},
    {"Treat the world beyond the PS2's 640x448 while the Camera Obscura is raised -- a port addition. Nothing to treat in a 4:3 window.", "举起射影机时，对 PS2 原始 640×448 画框外的扩展区域应用效果。4:3 窗口没有这片区域。"},
    {"How far it drains toward ink indigo and a cold, moonlit blue-white.", "调节画面转为靛蓝和冷白色的程度。"},
    {"Aim the raised Camera Obscura by moving the controller, alongside the stick. ", "举起射影机后，可转动手柄或推动摇杆瞄准。"},
    {"Its drift is learned whenever it lies still.", "手柄静置时会自动校准漂移。"},
    {"Vibration is off on the Game page.", "「游戏」页已关闭手柄振动。"},
    {"Feel heartbeats, blows, a ghost's grip, thunder and the cutscenes in the triggers as well. ", "通过扳机振动感受心跳、撞击、怨灵抓握、雷声和过场效果。"},
    {"Looking for this controller's trigger motors: press a button on it.", "正在检测扳机振动电机，请按一下手柄上的任意按键。"},
    {"For a controller with motors behind its triggers: Xbox One and later.", "适用于带扳机振动电机的手柄，例如 Xbox One 及更新型号。"},
    {"What changes the film with the Camera Obscura raised: the d-pad, or a stick. The other one aims.", "举起射影机时，可用方向键或摇杆更换胶卷。另一项输入将用于瞄准。"},
    {"With the Camera Obscura raised: which stick aims it and which walks. Without it, the left stick always walks.", "指定举起射影机时负责瞄准和移动的摇杆。放下射影机后，左摇杆负责移动。"},
    {"The mouse turns the over-the-shoulder camera and aims the Camera Obscura. The pointer is captured while it does and free in every menu, and while the overlay's bar is up: F1 hides it.", "用鼠标转动越肩镜头和瞄准射影机。操控镜头时锁定指针，打开菜单或调试栏时释放指针。F1 切换调试栏。"},
    {"The mouse button that raises the Camera Obscura (right, unless the overlay's Settings > Controls > Mouse moves it): held to keep it up, or clicked once to raise it and again to lower it.", "选择按住或单击切换射影机。默认使用鼠标右键，可在调试栏的「设置 → 控制 → 鼠标」修改。"},
    {"Forget the learned drift; set the controller down and keep it still to learn it again.", "清除已记录的漂移校正。将手柄静置即可重新校准。"},
    {"Feel the shutter, the charge and a shutter chance in the triggers. The original does not shake for these.", "快门、蓄力和快门时机触发扳机振动。"},
    {"Each motor in turn: the left grip, the right grip, and with trigger rumble the left and right triggers.", "依次测试左右握把。若启用了扳机振动，也会测试左右扳机。"},
    {"Every key, mouse button and controller button back to the defaults. F1 opens the overlay, whose Settings > Controls rebinds them one by one.", "将键盘、鼠标和手柄恢复到默认绑定。按 F1，在「设置 → 控制」可逐项重新绑定。"},
    {"Fixed: the game's own camera angles. Over the shoulder: a camera behind and beside her that the right stick turns and R3 puts back behind her; the left stick walks the way it is pushed, as the camera sees it. Events, the Camera Obscura and ladders keep their own cameras.", "「固定」使用原版视角。「越肩」可用右摇杆转动镜头，按 R3 回正，左摇杆按当前视角移动。事件、射影机和爬梯沿用各自的镜头。"},
    {"Pull in against the rooms and furniture as they are drawn: over a low table, short of a wall or a closed door.", "遇到墙、关着的门或家具时拉近镜头，避免穿过场景物体。"},
    {"When the game cuts to an event camera while you can still walk -- a ghost appearing, something to look at, the dream's graveyard path. Guided: stay over the shoulder and turn once towards what the shot frames; the right stick or mouse takes over at once. Original: the game's own shot. Off: stay over the shoulder. Moments that take control away always play their own shot.", "游戏在可移动时触发事件镜头的行为。「引导」先转向事件目标，随后由摇杆或鼠标接管。「原版」播放原镜头。「关闭」维持越肩视角。接管角色操作的过场始终使用原镜头。"},
    {"Drift back behind her while she walks and the right stick is idle.", "角色走动且右摇杆未输入时，镜头逐渐回到身后。"},
    {"Which way up and down turn the camera, on top of the Controls page's Point of view.", "在「控制」页视角方向的基础上，设置越肩镜头的垂直转向。"},
    {"The framing and options above back to their defaults; the camera stays on.", "恢复上述构图和设置的默认值，并保持越肩视角开启。"},
    {"That file is not one ReiPan can read. Choose an .iso (a .chd or .cso has to be turned back into an .iso first) or IMG_BD.BIN.", "无法识别该文件。请选择简中适配目录里的 IMG_BD.BIN。"},
    {"That disc image does not hold Fatal Frame III. Choose an image of your own European copy of the game.", "映像内找不到《零～刺青之声～》的游戏数据。请选择由 SLPS_255.44 生成的适配数据。"},
    {"That copy is cut short: the game's files run past the end of it. Copy or dump the disc again.", "游戏数据不完整。请从同版本 ISO 重新生成适配数据。"},
    {"That file could not be read. Check that it is still there and not in use, then choose it again.", "无法读取该文件。请确认文件仍在原处，关闭可能占用它的程序后重试。"},
    {"The file dialog could not be opened. Add the path as data_folder under [paths] in this file, then start ReiPan again:", "无法打开文件选择器。请在以下文件的 [paths] 下设置 data_folder，然后重启 ReiPan。"},
