    {"Measurement harness; not saved to reipan.ini.", "计时测试，结果不会写入 reipan.ini。"},
    {"Watch 'deadline miss' in the summary: rising at", "观察摘要中的「超时次数」。"},
    {"1 field means the workload exceeds 16.7 ms.", "单场周期下若持续增加，单次负载超过 16.7 毫秒。"},
    {"At most %d extra: the game waits %d fields a tick", "最多插入 %d 场，每次游戏更新等待 %d 场"},
    {"and vfunc() always keeps the last one for itself.", "其中最后一场由 vfunc() 使用。"},
    {"The simulation keeps its own rate either way -- the", "游戏逻辑保持原有更新率。"},
    {"extra fields come out of the wait the game already", "插入的帧使用游戏原本等待的时间，"},
    {"does, so nothing speeds up.  Watch 'present/frame'", "因此游戏速度保持原样。"},
    {"in the summary follow this.", "可在摘要中查看「每逻辑帧呈现次数」。"},
    {"With interpolation off the picture must not change.", "关闭插帧时应保持原有画面。"},
    {"'Interpolate motion' moves the world as well as the", "「运动插值」同时更新镜头和场景。"},
    {"eye: characters and moving objects stop stepping at", "角色与活动物体的动作更连贯，"},
    {"30 Hz.  It re-uploads the vertex buffer once per", "超出原有 30 Hz 的画面步进。"},
    {"present, so 'Renderer upload' rises with the frame", "每次呈现会重新上传一次顶点。"},
    {"rate -- with it off, upload must stay flat.  Watch", "渲染上传耗时随帧率变化，关闭时应持平。"},
    {"'geo' in the summary: it is the share of 3D draws", "摘要中的「几何匹配」是找到上一帧对应项的"},
    {"that found a matching draw last frame.", "3D 绘制任务所占的比例。"},
    {"Worst logical frame in each ~1 s window. Inclusive phases overlap.", "每个约一秒区间最慢的逻辑帧。各阶段耗时可能重叠。"},
    {"CPU phases are inclusive and may overlap; do not add the curves.", "各 CPU 阶段耗时包含子阶段，曲线可能重叠，无法相加。"},
    {"Ideal draws = commands - compatible adjacent joins.", "理想绘制次数等于命令数减去可合并的相邻绘制数。"},
    {"  running at %dx (device maximum %dx)", "  当前 %d 倍（设备最高 %d 倍）"},
    {"  smooths geometry edges in the frame the game is", "  平滑游戏帧中的几何边缘。"},
    {"  drawn into. Everything read back out of that frame", "  相片、暂停画面和读取画面的特效"},
    {"  -- photographs, the pause still, effect grabs --", "  使用采样合成后的结果，"},
    {"  sees the resolved copy, so none of them changes.", "  保留原有用途。"},
    {"  Cost: this game samples the frame buffer for its", "  每次特效读取帧缓冲"},
    {"  effects, and each such grab forces a full resolve,", "  都需要一次完整的多重采样合成，"},
    {"  so an effect-heavy scene costs far more than a", "  因而特效密集的场景开销更高。"},
    {"  plain one. Gameplay visibility uses its own depth", "  游戏可见性检测始终使用"},
    {"  pass at every MSAA setting.", "  独立的深度渲染过程。"},
    {"Anisotropic filtering (all textures)", "各向异性过滤（全部纹理）"},
    {"  running at %dx (device refused the request)", "  当前 %d 倍（设备拒绝了所选倍率）"},
    {"  stops tatami and corridor floors shimmering at", "  减少斜视榻榻米和走廊地板时的闪烁。"},
    {"  grazing angles. No extra passes, no extra memory.", "  无需额外的渲染过程或内存。"},
    {"  Only where the PS2 asked for linear filtering in", "  适用于 PS2 要求横纵双向线性过滤的纹理，"},
    {"  both directions, so point-sampled art is untouched.", "  点采样图案沿用原样。"},
    {"  The port keeps one mip level per GS page, so this", "  移植版每个 GS 纹理页保留一级，"},
    {"  supersamples the texel footprint rather than", "  通过多采样覆盖的纹素实现过滤。"},
    {"  picking a mip -- it helps the near and middle of a", "  近处和中距离地面的"},
    {"  floor much more than the far end of one.", "  改善比远处更明显。"},
    {"  one grain per screen pixel, whatever the", "  每个屏幕像素对应一粒，"},
    {"  resolution -- same density and drift as the PS2", "  密度和漂移方式沿用 PS2。"},
    {"PS2 (128x128 sheet)", "PS2（128×128 纹理）"},
    {"  faithful: one grain per 640x448 pixel, so each", "  每个 640×448 原始画面像素对应一粒，"},
    {"  one arrives as big as your upscale makes it", "  颗粒随画面等比放大。"},
    {"  restores the one-texel alpha edge on foliage,", "  保持树叶、栅栏和头发的"},
    {"  fences and hair that magnification softens", "  单纹素透明边缘清晰。"},
    {"  0.00 is the hardware's own edge; no effect at", "  0.00 使用硬件默认边缘。"},
    {"  or below native resolution whatever it is set to", "  原始分辨率及更低分辨率下无效果。"},
    {"  discards any texel below this outright -- a", "  丢弃低于此阈值的纹素。"},
    {"  blunter tool than Sharpen, and independent of", "  此项独立于边缘锐化，"},
    {"  it. Aliases the edge, applies at every", "  在所有分辨率下生效。"},
    {"  resolution, and can thin hair and far foliage.", "  可能出现锯齿，使头发和远处树叶变细。"},
    {"  0.00 off; 0.50 is the usual cut-out midpoint.", "  0.00 关闭，常用截断阈值为 0.50。"},
    {"  a port addition -- the PS2 rendered 640x448", "  对 PS2 原始 640×448 画框外的"},
    {"  and nothing beyond it. No effect on a 4:3", "  扩展区域应用效果。"},
    {"  window, where there is nothing outside.", "  4:3 窗口没有扩展区域。"},
    {"  darken 1.00 with blur 0.00 is a black", "  暗化 1.00 且模糊 0.00 时，"},
    {"  surround rather than a defocused one", "  扩展区域显示为纯黑。"},
    {"  drains the colour toward ink indigo and", "  将色彩偏向深靛蓝"},
    {"  a cold, moonlit blue-white", "  和冷白色。"},
    {"  1.00 is the original 640x448 frame; below", "  1.00 对应 PS2 原始 640×448 画框。"},
    {"  it the surround covers game composition", "  设得更小会覆盖原画面边缘。"},
