    {"press...", "请按键…"},
    {"Also bound to %s -- both will fire", "同时绑定至 %s，两个动作都会触发"},
    {"These 16 buttons and 4 stick axes are what the whole game reads through, so rebinding one here moves it everywhere at once. Click a binding, then press the key, gamepad button or trigger you want.", "游戏通过这 16 个按键和 4 个摇杆轴读取输入。点击绑定项后，按下键盘按键、手柄按钮或扳机即可绑定。"},
    {"Esc cancels   Backspace clears   up to %d sources per button", "Esc 取消，退格清除。每个按键最多绑定 %d 项输入"},
    {"no gamepads connected", "未连接手柄"},
    {"Ramp is how many updates a held key takes to reach full deflection: 1 snaps, which is what movement wants, while a higher value makes keyboard aiming steerable instead of all-or-nothing.", "渐进帧数决定按键从按下到模拟全幅输入需要几次更新。移动可设为 1，瞄准可设得更高以便微调。"},
    {"Where ReiPan reads the game's files from: ZERO3.FHD with IMG_BD.BIN or an extracted bin/data tree, or a disc image (.iso). It can be anywhere on this device -- nothing requires it to be next to ReiPan.", "选择 ReiPan 读取的游戏数据目录，其中包含适配后的 ZERO3.FHD 和 IMG_BD.BIN。"},
    {"Empty: look for the game beside ReiPan and above it, and save whatever is found here.", "留空时会在 ReiPan 所在目录及上层查找游戏数据，并保存找到的位置。"},
    {"  presented at %dx%d +%d+%d", "  呈现区域 %d×%d，偏移 +%d+%d"},
    {"  drawing with %s", "  当前图形后端 %s"},
    {"  restart ReiPan to switch to %s", "  重启 ReiPan 后切换到 %s"},
    {"  %s could not be started", "  无法启动 %s"},
    {"  SDL_GPU_DRIVER overrides this setting", "  环境变量 SDL_GPU_DRIVER 覆盖此设置"},
    {"  Bilinear text and sprite textures, including effects; off uses PS2 sampling.", "  对文字、精灵和特效纹理使用双线性过滤。关闭后沿用 PS2 采样。"},
    {"  rasterised at %dx%d", "  渲染分辨率 %d×%d"},
    {"Every light on the CPU, once per vertex. What the PS2 did.", "由 CPU 为每个顶点计算全部灯光，沿用 PS2 的方式。"},
    {"Spotlights per pixel, the rest per vertex on the CPU.", "逐像素计算聚光灯，其他灯光由 CPU 逐顶点计算。"},
    {"The whole light image per pixel; no CPU vertex lighting at all.\nSharper speculars and cone edges than the PS2 had.", "逐像素计算全部照明。\n高光和聚光灯边缘更清晰。"},
    {"One tap of the silhouette, as the projected sprite gave.", "对投影阴影轮廓采样一次，沿用精灵阴影的方式。"},
    {"Average a 3x3 of the silhouette.", "对阴影轮廓计算 3×3 邻域平均值。"},
