    {"The shutter, the charge and a shutter chance.", "快门、蓄力和快门时机。"},
    {"Right stick turns it, R3 puts it behind her.", "用右摇杆转动镜头，按 R3 将镜头移回角色身后。"},
    {"Events, the viewfinder and ladders keep their own.", "事件、取景和爬梯沿用各自的镜头。"},
    {"When the game cuts to an event camera while", "适用于仍可移动时"},
    {"she can still walk.", "触发的事件镜头。"},
