    {"The game's cameras are not running here.", "此处的游戏镜头当前未运行。"},
    {"Not on screen: the game is using its %s.", "越肩镜头未显示，当前使用%s。"},
    {"Yaw %.0f  pitch %.0f%s%s", "偏航 %.0f，俯仰 %.0f%s%s"},
    {"Back %.1f of %.1f  (scenery allows %.1f)", "后移 %.1f / %.1f（场景最多允许 %.1f）"},
    {"Scenery: %d pieces, %d crossed, %d triangles", "场景物体 %d 个，相交 %d 个，三角形 %d 个"},
    {"Stopped by a piece %.1f x %.1f x %.1f", "被尺寸为 %.1f × %.1f × %.1f 的物体挡住"},
    {"As a fully played save: every difficulty, the start menu\non New Game (the game counts as cleared once), every\nbonus-shop entry bought -- costumes, accessories, gallery\npictures, lenses and camera functions -- both gallery\nmovies and every extra-mission group. Put back every\nframe while ticked, since each game start wipes it; a\nsave made meanwhile keeps it. Unticking leaves what is set\n(reipan/debug/reipan_assists.cpp).", "模拟已完全通关的存档。解锁全部难度、通关菜单、商店物品、画廊和额外任务。\n启用期间会在每帧重新应用。保存游戏可保留解锁结果，关闭后保留当前已解锁项目。"},
    {"  shadows %d / caster draws %d / receiver draws %d / map %s", "  阴影 %d / 投射绘制 %d / 接收绘制 %d / 阴影图 %s"},
    {"Rooms, furniture and doors are decoded once and drawn from\nGPU buffers, with neighbouring parts merged into one draw.\nOff re-decodes and re-uploads every mesh every frame, as the\nPS2-shaped path always has -- the A/B if anything differs.", "房间、家具和门只解码一次，使用 GPU 缓冲区绘制，并合并相邻图元。\n关闭后每帧重新解码并上传网格，可用于对照画面差异。"},
    {"Each room, piece of furniture and door resolves its textures\nonce, and then stops uploading them to the emulated GS every\nframe. Off re-sends and re-hashes them every draw, as the PS2\ndid -- the A/B if a texture looks wrong.", "房间、家具和门的纹理只解析一次，随后复用。\n关闭后每次绘制重新上传并计算哈希，可用于排查纹理异常。"},
    {"The cone the game tests for Rei's light (40 degrees,\n1200 units) in blue, its reach in yellow, a box around\nher in green and her facing in red, drawn with FF3's\nown unused debug line helpers.", "蓝色表示手电筒照明的锥形区域（40 度、1200 单位），黄色表示照射距离。\n绿色框标出角色位置，红线表示面朝方向。"},
