    {"MapPut candidate %.1f/%llu | drawable %.1f/%llu | compare %.1f/%llu", "MapPut 候选 %.1f/%llu | 可绘制 %.1f/%llu | 比较 %.1f/%llu"},
    {"MapPut callbacks %.1f/%llu | object draws %.1f/%llu", "MapPut 回调 %.1f/%llu | 物体绘制 %.1f/%llu"},
    {"%zu draws | %zu verts", "绘制 %zu 次 | 顶点 %zu 个"},
    {"Mesh tri %d | clip %d", "网格三角形 %d | 裁剪 %d"},
    {"Resident %zu meshes %.1f MiB | %.0f units -> %.0f draws/frame | built %d", "常驻网格 %zu 个、%.1f MiB | %.0f 单元合为 %.0f 次每帧绘制 | 已构建 %d"},
    {"GS uploads %.1f/frame %.0f KB/frame | model TRI2 skipped %.1f/frame replayed %.1f/frame | bound %d", "GS 上传 %.1f 次/帧、%.0f KB/帧 | 模型 TRI2 跳过 %.1f 次/帧，重放 %.1f 次/帧 | 绑定 %d"},
    {"Mesh cache %d/%d | new %d | evict %d | inv %d | fail %d", "网格缓存 %d/%d | 新增 %d | 淘汰 %d | 失效 %d | 失败 %d"},
    {"Mesh resident %zu | %.1f MiB | avoided %zu verts", "常驻网格 %zu 个 | %.1f MiB | 节省顶点 %zu 个"},
    {"Mesh warm pending %zu | promoted %d | build defer %d | upload defer %d", "待预加载网格 %zu | 已提升 %d | 延迟构建 %d | 延迟上传 %d"},
    {"Mesh arenas %zu pages | %.1f MiB allocated", "网格内存池 %zu 页 | 已分配 %.1f MiB"},
    {"Mesh upload cache %.1f MiB | colour %.1f MiB | animated %.1f MiB", "网格上传缓存 %.1f MiB | 颜色 %.1f MiB | 动画 %.1f MiB"},
    {"Animated unique %zu | expansion avoided %zu | %.2fx smaller", "动画独立项 %zu | 避免展开 %zu | 压缩倍率 %.2f"},
    {"Mesh direct %zu verts | %.1f MiB staging avoided", "网格直接上传顶点 %zu | 节省中转内存 %.1f MiB"},
    {"Texture L1 %d/%d | L2 %d", "纹理一级缓存 %d/%d | 二级缓存 %d"},
    {"Texture new %d | dl %d | inv %d", "纹理新增 %d | 下载 %d | 失效 %d"},
    {"Font %d/%d | new %d | inv %d", "字形 %d/%d | 新增 %d | 失效 %d"},
    {"%d samples / %.1f s. Average lines are per logical frame; max lines are the worst frame in each ~1 s sample.", "%d 个样本 / %.1f 秒。平均线按逻辑帧计算，峰值线为约一秒区间内最慢的一帧。"},
    {"Frame", "帧"},
    {"Game %.1f FPS | Present %.1f FPS | present/frame %.2f | cam %s/tick | geo %s", "游戏 %.1f FPS | 呈现 %.1f FPS | 每逻辑帧呈现 %.2f 次 | 镜头 %s/次 | 几何匹配 %s"},
    {"Not on the title screen. Changes show the next time it comes up.", "当前不在标题界面。下次返回标题时应用改动。"},
    {"Showing the original background.", "当前显示原版背景。"},
    {"The attract movie has the screen; the room comes back after it.", "演示影片播放中，结束后恢复房间背景。"},
    {"The scenes below, lit and animated as the game plays them,\nbehind the original logo and menus.", "用游戏中的光照和动画渲染下列场景，作为原版标志和菜单的背景。"},
    {"The original title, movie and picture of Rei and all -- exactly\nthe original's, apart from the music choice below.", "沿用原版标题背景、影片和角色图像。音乐可在下方选择。"},
    {"In the rotation.  Off keeps the scene, and keeps it out.", "勾选后加入轮播，取消勾选后仍可编辑该场景。"},
    {"A new scene in the opening room (RS106), placed by itself.  Pick\nits room and move its points from there.", "在开场房间 RS106 添加一个场景，并自动放置镜头。可随后更换房间和调整位置。"},
    {"A copy of the selected scene, to vary.", "复制所选场景以便修改。"},
    {"Remove the selected scene.  The last one cannot go.", "移除所选场景，至少保留一个场景。"},
    {"Scenes are picked at random among the ticked ones, never the\nsame one twice running while there is another.", "随机轮播已勾选的场景。有多个可用场景时不会连续重复。"},
    {"Off holds the title on the selected scene for as long as this\nwindow is open, so it does not fade away while it is edited.", "关闭轮播后，此窗口打开期间会停在所选场景，便于编辑。"},
    {"The selected scene, as a [title.scene] section of reipan.ini.", "复制所选场景的 [title.scene] 配置段。"},
    {"[title] and every scene, exactly as reipan.ini has them.", "复制 reipan.ini 中的 [title] 配置段和全部场景。"},
    {"Every [title.scene] section on the clipboard, added after the\nscenes here.", "将剪贴板中的 [title.scene] 配置段追加到当前场景列表。"},
    {"The clipboard's scenes instead of these, and its [title]\nsettings -- backdrop, rotation, dim, music -- if it has them.", "用剪贴板里的场景替换当前列表。有 [title] 配置时也应用其背景、轮播、暗化和音乐设置。"},
    {"Rooms by the area number the game gives them and their model\nfile's name.  A new room starts with the camera placed by\nitself; set the two points to taste after.  Greyed rooms are\nnot on this disc.", "按游戏区域编号和模型文件名选择房间。更换房间时会自动放置镜头，也可手动调整起点和终点。灰色房间在此光盘版本中不可用。"},
    {"Load the room again from the disc.", "从光盘数据重新载入房间。"},
    {"The house's rooms have night lighting of their own, as the game\nshows them after dark.  The Manor has one lighting only.", "住宅房间有游戏夜间使用的独立光照，庄园使用同一套光照。"},
    {"Hold the camera on this point; again to let the path run.", "将镜头停在此点。再次点击可继续移动。"},
    {"(holding)", "（已暂停）"},
    {"Where the camera is, in the game's world units.  Y grows\ndownwards; Rei is about seventeen tall.", "镜头的游戏世界坐标。Y 轴朝下，角色身高约 17 个单位。"},
    {"Smooth eases out of each end and into the next.", "平滑模式会在镜头路径的起点和终点缓入缓出。"},
    {"Seconds from A to B.", "设置从 A 移动到 B 的秒数。"},
    {"Seconds the camera rests at each end.", "设置镜头在路径两端停留的秒数。"},
    {"Where along the path the camera is -- drag it to scrub.", "拖动以预览镜头沿路径的位置。"},
    {"Steer the camera by hand, then \"Set from the current view\".\nWith the pad (or the keys bound to it in Settings > Controls):\n  move     left stick\n  look     right stick\n  up/down  R1 / L1\n  speed    hold L2 for slow, R2 for fast\nThe title's menus do not hear the pad while this is on.", "先手动移动镜头，再选择「从当前视角设置」。\n左摇杆移动，右摇杆转向。R1 和 L1 控制升降，按住 L2 慢移、R2 快移。\n此模式下手柄用于操控镜头。"},
    {"Put both points back where a new room starts them: the room's\nfirst shot of its own below, or with none, along the floor at\neye height looking at the middle.", "将两点恢复为房间的默认位置。优先使用房间的第一个镜头，否则在视线高度朝向房间中央。"},
    {"The room's own shot %d of %d", "房间原有镜头 %d / %d"},
    {"The room's own shots: %d", "房间原有镜头共 %d 个"},
    {"The fixed cameras the game cuts between in this room, as its\ndesigners placed them.  Each sets both points: that eye and\nfield of view, panning a few degrees either side of its aim.", "房间原有的固定镜头。选中后两端沿用该镜头的位置和视野，可在朝向两侧小幅转动。"},
    {"Show it##show_selected", "显示##show_selected"},
    {"Black laid over the room and under the logo and menus, to keep\nthem readable over a bright room.", "给背景加暗色遮罩，便于看清标志和菜单。"},
    {"The original rolls a movie after thirty idle seconds on PRESS\nSTART.  Off keeps the room up.  The original background always\nplays it.", "原版标题界面闲置 30 秒后会播放演示。关闭后可保持房间背景，使用原版背景时仍会播放演示。"},
    {"Original is the title theme the way the game plays it.\nAnything else loops for as long as the title is up, and stops\nwith it as the theme does.  The KAN tracks are the rooms' own\nambience.  Greyed tracks are not on this disc.", "「原版」使用原游戏的标题音乐。其他曲目在标题界面循环播放。KAN 曲目对应房间环境音，灰色曲目在此光盘版本中不可用。"},
    {"1 is the level the game plays its music at.", "1.00 对应游戏原本的音乐音量。"},
    {"The title screen's backdrop -- scenes from the\ngame, or the original movie -- their cameras and\nthe music.", "设置标题背景、场景镜头及音乐。"},
    {"Saved to reipan.ini, [title] and [title.sceneN].", "已保存至 reipan.ini 中的 [title] 和 [title.sceneN]。"},
    {"Chapter %u / Room %d", "第 %u 章 / 房间 %d"},
    {"Step %d of %d: %s", "第 %d 步，共 %d 步。%s"},
    {"Select source saves, then choose a destination slot for each.", "选择源存档，并为每个存档指定目标槽位。"},
    {"%d of %d saves selected", "已选择 %d / %d 个存档"},
    {"Region: %s", "存档地区 %s"},
    {"Choose the output format", "选择导出格式"},
    {"Choose a format, then confirm the destination in the file picker to export immediately.", "选择格式后，在文件选择器中确认存放位置即可导出。"},
    {"Save archives contain this game's selected saves, not a whole memory card.", "导出档案仅包含所选的游戏存档。"},
    {"Run it without its open conditions -- the ROM's forced start\n(EV_SET_STATE 1), applied in the next frame's event pass.\nWhat it expects (a room, a ghost, an NPC) is not set up for it.", "将在下一帧事件处理中强制启用此事件（EV_SET_STATE 1）。\n请确认事件要求的房间与角色已经准备好。"},
    {"Set it to ended without running it, so whatever waits on it\ncan go ahead.", "直接把事件标记为已结束，让等待此事件的后续流程继续。"},
    {"Put it back to waiting for its open conditions, so it can\nhappen again.", "将事件恢复为等待触发条件，使它可以再次发生。"},
    {"Its conditions name no place to go to.", "条件里没有可跳转的位置。"},
    {"Copy all of this, the judgement included, to paste in a note\nor a bug report.", "复制诊断中的全部内容和判定结果，便于记入笔记或错误报告。"},
    {"Do not wait for the event program that is running. The\nroom change cuts it short, so expect it to misbehave.", "立即切换房间会中断正在运行的事件程序。"},
    {"Hide events with no program and no sub-events: markers other\nevents test, with nothing to see.", "隐藏没有程序和子事件的状态标记。这些标记仅供其他事件检查。"},
    {"Examine points, doors and pick-ups, a group per area. They run in every Hour; their conditions say which.", "调查点、门和可拾取物品按区域分组。可触发的章节由各事件条件决定。"},
    {"ingame_wrk.b01 at the start. The chapter's event (under event 88)\nopens and runs its start event, the developers' chapter select:\nit moves the world, the area and Rei as the story would.", "设置开场的 ingame_wrk.b01。章节事件（事件 88 的子事件）会运行自己的启动事件，设置世界、区域及角色位置。"},
    {"EVENT_DB_OBJ instead of EVENT_OBJ: the developers' debug start\nevent 1746 opens instead of 1060 (fade in, control, camera\nunlocked, random ghosts on). Everything else is the same file.", "载入 EVENT_DB_OBJ。调试启动事件 1746 负责淡入、解锁控制与镜头并启用随机怨灵。"},
    {"EventSetStop(1): no event program or condition runs (NPCs, the\ncat and the map still do; the cat stays off unless switched on\nbelow, since event 5 does it). Use Events below to run one.", "EventSetStop(1) 暂停事件条件和程序，NPC 与地图仍更新。可在下方手动触发单个事件。"},
    {"%s, ran %d time(s)", "%s，已运行 %d 次"},
    {"New Game then opens the start menu (extra mode, missions, gallery, costumes);\nHard (and Nightmare after a Hard clear) on the difficulty select. Kept until unticked.", "新游戏将打开通关菜单，包含额外模式、任务、画廊及服装。难度页显示困难，困难通关后会解锁噩梦。"},
    {"active %d  loaded %d  visible %d  run_act %d  type %d  acs %d", "激活 %d  已加载 %d  可见 %d  run_act %d  类型 %d  acs %d"},
    {"models: body %s, part %s, accessory %s", "模型：主体 %s，部件 %s，配件 %s"},
    {"area %d  pos (%.1f, %.1f, %.1f)  facing %.2f", "区域 %d，坐标（%.1f，%.1f，%.1f），朝向 %.2f"},
    {"act %d  label %d  step %d  move %d/%d  sub %d/%d  next %d", "动作 %d  标签 %d  步进 %d  移动 %d/%d  子动作 %d/%d  下一个 %d"},
    {"stay %d  idle %d step %d left %d  pet %d->%d  look %d eye %d  door %d", "停留 %d  待机 %d 步进 %d 剩余 %d  抚摸 %d→%d  朝向 %d  眼睛 %d  门 %d"},
    {"motion %d / %d  fixed %d  locks %d%d%d%d%d%d", "动画 %d / %d  固定 %d  锁定 %d%d%d%d%d%d"},
    {"%.0f deg", "%.0f 度"},
    {"%.1f deg", "%.1f 度"},
    {"1.00 is the original frame; smaller covers part of the picture.", "1.00 保留原版画面范围。调小会遮住部分画面。"},
    {"3rd person: push where to go, as the camera sees it. 1st person: forward and back walk, left and right turn.", "第三人称按画面方向移动。第一人称用前后键移动，用左右键转身。"},
    {"1.00x turns the view as far as the controller turns.", "设为 1.00 倍时，视角旋转幅度与手柄一致。"},
    {"Yaw: point the controller left and right. Roll: tip it sideways like a wheel.", "偏航是将手柄向左或向右转动，横滚是像打方向盘一样倾斜手柄。"},
